.
├── .cursor/              # Cursor editor configuration
│   └── rules/            # Cursor rules for documentation
├── data/                 # User and application data
│   ├── assets/           # User-uploaded files
│   │   ├── ken_v1/       # Assets for user ken_v1
│   │   ├── ken_v2/       # Assets for user ken_v2
